Package: loopQTL
Type: Package
Title: Anchor-Restricted Loop QTL Mapping from Hi-C
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Zexun", "Wu", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "zexunwu@usc.edu")
Description: Maps chromatin loop QTLs by testing whether genotype at a loop's
    anchors associates with the loop's contact strength across samples. Reads
    .hic files via strawr, builds a bin-matched consensus loop set, normalizes
    contact strength across samples (multiHiCcompare fastlo, or band-wise
    quantile normalization in the style of BNBC via preprocessCore), and runs
    anchor-restricted SNP-by-loop regressions with MatrixEQTL. Intra-chromosomal
    loops only; no FDR or lead-SNP selection (left to the user).
URL: https://github.com/tim-wuuu/loopQTL
BugReports: https://github.com/tim-wuuu/loopQTL/issues
